OL,4,CWestminster setting NI budget would be 
OL,5,Cmassive overreach - O'Neill            
OL,6,GThe government setting Stormont's      
OL,7,Gbudget would be a "massive overreach", 
OL,8,GNorthern Ireland's First Minister      
OL,9,GMichelle O'Neill has said.             
OL,11,FShe described the prospect as a        
OL,12,F"dangerous precedent" and said the     
OL,13,Fpower-sharing executive would continue 
OL,14,Fpressing Westminster for "fairer       
OL,15,Ffunding".                              
OL,17,FThe Sinn Fein vice-president said she  
OL,18,Fhad asked Deputy First Minister Emma   
OL,19,FLittle-Pengelly to join her in seeking 
OL,20,F"direct engagement" with Prime         
OL,21,FMinister Andy Burnham on the budget    
OL,22,Fstalemate.                        G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
