OL,4,CMother and son riot ringleaders jailed 
OL,5,Cfor 'disgraceful' acts                 
OL,6,GA mother and son described as          
OL,7,Gringleaders of rioting that targeted   
OL,8,Gethnic minorities have been jailed for 
OL,9,Gwhat a judge called their "disgraceful 
OL,10,Gactivities".                           
OL,12,FKelvin Kane, 32, of HMP Maghaberry,    
OL,13,Fwas jailed for four years on Monday    
OL,14,Fafter admitting 17 charges connected   
OL,15,Fwith rioting in Ballymena in the       
OL,16,Fsummer of 2025.                        
OL,18,FHis mother Tracy Kane, 51, of Galgorm  
OL,19,FStreet in the town, was jailed for two 
OL,20,Fyears after admitting two counts       
OL,21,Fincluding encouraging and assisting    
OL,22,Fher son's crimes.                 G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
