OL,4,CWoman faces hour-long drive to give    
OL,5,Cbirth as hospital suspends maternity   
OL,6,Cservices                               
OL,7,GA couple who are expecting their first 
OL,8,Gchild have said their excitement has   
OL,9,Gturned "into complete worry" because   
OL,10,Gof the suspension of maternity         
OL,11,Gservices at their local hospital.      
OL,13,FShelly Magee was due to give birth in  
OL,14,FNewry's Daisy Hill Hospital in County  
OL,15,FArmagh in January but from Monday, the 
OL,16,FSouthern Trust is moving all hospital- 
OL,17,Fbased births to Craigavon, about 20    
OL,18,Fmiles away.                            
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
